03690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/ac20f4cfa103a8860c94604da320adb4.mp4?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiao Xiaoxiao: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;father&quot;, biologically female and heterosexual, but sociologically male, as the SB system labeled her as such. As a result, everyone, including herself, treats her as a man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/9de529db8c9413703137646f10a01340.poster.avif?t=1743403690\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/9de529db8c9413703137646f10a01340.webm?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/9de529db8c9413703137646f10a01340.mp4?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wei Weiwei: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your household\u2019s &quot;nanny robot&quot;, serial number MVV1984, a former wanderer, \u00a0later reintegrated into human society, now assigned to your community as a nanny robot after passing the &quot;Reverse-Turing&quot; test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/b5c87ac3ecd7e373ede0be4e76fccfb8.poster.avif?t=1743403690\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/b5c87ac3ecd7e373ede0be4e76fccfb8.webm?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/b5c87ac3ecd7e373ede0be4e76fccfb8.mp4?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jia Jiajia: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The administrator of you community, an awakened &quot;servant&quot;, with an intelligence level of eighty. Her path to advancement is currently hindered by multiplication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/99fa5f143f37b63d550a44ee8f0bb39c.poster.avif?t=1743403690\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/99fa5f143f37b63d550a44ee8f0bb39c.webm?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/99fa5f143f37b63d550a44ee8f0bb39c.mp4?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qin Qingqing: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;aunt&quot;, the younger sister of Lin Lingling, a hot star of the day, whose hit film  swept five major awards worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/64b54aa1ab351583b75b1cceddcb8bba.poster.avif?t=1743403690\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/64b54aa1ab351583b75b1cceddcb8bba.webm?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/64b54aa1ab351583b75b1cceddcb8bba.mp4?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Handler: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your &quot;learning&quot; coach, also the Sovereign Brain government service representative for your region.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/2e8b729fc5c6c68b7bdbcb4b68900de0.poster.avif?t=1743403690\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/2e8b729fc5c6c68b7bdbcb4b68900de0.webm?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/2e8b729fc5c6c68b7bdbcb4b68900de0.mp4?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game Features:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-Driven Narrative: The decisions will shape the narrative and lead to diverse outcomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Reward Drop&quot;: As you learn about the SB society and undergo intelligence tests, you will receive encouragement from your coach, and upon completion, you will earn generous &quot;Reward Drop&quot;.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/427c368b180c7defaebd99477be2d738.poster.avif?t=1743403690\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/427c368b180c7defaebd99477be2d738.webm?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382300/extras/427c368b180c7defaebd99477be2d738.mp4?t=1743403690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>About Us</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Mountain &amp; Sea Studio, dedicated to crafting live-action interactive 